From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:43:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: bluetooth: brcm: Add iPhone 6s Plus
 BCM4350C5

The iPhone 6s Plus (N66) has a BCM4350C5 in its USI or Murata
"Pinotnoir" module, on a UART. iOS loads its Patchram from BlueTool as
"BCM4350C5_..._Pinotnoir_OS_{USI,MUR}_BM_MCC".

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
index aecd8e794..88ba22135 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ properties:
           - const: brcm,bcm4329-bt
       - enum:
           - apple,j81-bcm4350c2-bt
+          - apple,n66-bcm4350c5-bt
           - apple,n102-bcm4345b1-bt
           - brcm,bcm20702a1
           - brcm,bcm4329-bt
